A community member asked if we could organize a dinner after the 
developer meeting (you pay for your food).

We located a place that sounds like I can handle a large group.

https://www.shivarestaurant.nl/

(I think this is the correct address)

If you will be in the area, no need to attend any of the "official 
event" and would like to meet up with community people for dinner. Add 
yourself to the list on the wiki:

https://www.openembedded.org/wiki/OEDEM2025

If you have issues signing up, email me and I can add you. Please add 
your name at the bottom of the list in case we go over what we can get a 
reservation for. If we move fast, there is potential for reserving the 
venue. So add your name ASAP :)

If you want to attend the developer meeting add your name to the 
waitlist on pretix.

There will be a Yocto Project lounge at OSSEU. Keep an eye on social 
media for details on how to find it. And do not forget the Yocto Project 
developer day Thursday after OSSEU.

https://pretalx.com/ypdd-amsterdam-2025/

I am looking forward to seeing everyone sometime in Amsterdam.

Philip

